{"id": 17892, "title": "Citizen of the World", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK2"], "slug": "citizen-of-the-world", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/17892_citizen-of-the-world.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["我是哪里人？这个问题很难回答。我的爸爸是美国人，妈妈是韩国人。我在泰国出生，在中国长大，现在在法国读大学。我爱每个地方的文化，也会说不同国家的语言，还有很多不同国家的朋友。你问我是哪里人，我会说我是世界公民。你呢？你是哪里人？"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["我是哪裏人？這個問題很難回答。我的爸爸是美國人，媽媽是韓國人。我在泰國出生，在中國長大，現在在法國讀大學。我愛每個地方的文化，也會說不同國家的語言，還有很多不同國家的朋友。你問我是哪裏人，我會說我是世界公民。你呢？你是哪裏人？"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["wǒ shì nǎ lǐ rén？ zhè gè wèn tí hěn nán huí dá。 wǒ de bà ba shì Měi guó rén， mā ma shì Hán guó rén。 wǒ zài Tài guó chū shēng， zài Zhōng guó zhǎng dà， xiàn zài zài Fǎ guó dú dà xué。 wǒ ài měi gè dì fang de wén huà， yě huì shuō bù tóng guó jiā de yǔ yán， hái yǒu hěn duō bù tóng guó jiā de péng you。 nǐ wèn wǒ shì nǎ lǐ rén， wǒ huì shuō wǒ shì shì jiè gōng mín。 nǐ ne？ nǐ shì nǎ lǐ rén？"], "english_paragraphs": ["Where am I from? This question is difficult to answer. My father is American and my mother is Korean. I was born in Thailand, grew up in China, and now attend university in France. I love the culture of every place, I can speak the languages ​​of different countries, and I have many friends from different countries. If you ask me where I am from, I would say I am a citizen of the world. And you? Where are you from?"], "english_full": "Where am I from? This question is difficult to answer. My father is American and my mother is Korean. I was born in Thailand, grew up in China, and now attend university in France. I love the culture of every place, I can speak the languages ​​of different countries, and I have many friends from different countries. If you ask me where I am from, I would say I am a citizen of the world. And you? Where are you from?", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shì\" data-defn=